      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "INHERITED CHARM (6) recorded his 8th career win last time out (19.40) at this track and drawn box 6 for the first time here. Goes very well at the trip finding the frame in each of five starts. Ran the fastest time on the program in his latest win. Hard to fault his form and makes plenty of appeal again. GOODNIGHT JASPER (8) could manage only second at Launceston last time but impressed when clocking a swift 25.94 over 461m at this track three starts ago. Has the ability and can find winning form again. DEWANA LIPINSKI (1) copped a check in the run and finished a well held 7 lengths seventh (20.41) last time in a Restricted WIN at this track over 340m. Key chance on best form. SCARRED (3) has claims fresh from a recent placing.",
